OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm plan rejected amid     
OL,4,Avillage objections                     
OL,6,FDespite being recommended for approval,
OL,7,FDurham County Council's (DCC) planning 
OL,8,Fcommittee voted to reject the plans.   
OL,9,FSunderland City Council is yet to make 
OL,10,Fa decision on part of the scheme within
OL,11,Fits boundary.                          
